    "detailed_description": "<strong>Enter Missile City limits and compete in the newest Ponglike, inspired by the head-to-head competition of the arcade era!</strong><br><br>Join the AeroLeague and choose from a rogue's gallery of athletes, each with their own unique kit of special moves, and start climbing the ranks in pursuit of Championship Belts!<br><br>- Win by getting your disc into the opponent's goal OR by knocking them out!<br>- Diverse cast of firejammers, street gang leaders, child prodigies, and telekenetic amazons!<br>- Customize and counterpick by choosing your special moves before each match!<br>- Local and online multiplayer!",
